<section>
  <h2>Appendix · Method</h2>
  <p>
    Multi-LLM fan-out against a naive prompt; responses compiled from
    <code>exploration.md</code> with lossless chunking, per-chunk extraction,
    clustering, and scored reporting. Contested, outlier, sensitive, and
    single-source findings are retained and classified — not dropped.
  </p>
  {% if data.response_corpus %}
  <h3>Normalized responses</h3>
  <p>Every model × probe after localization. Hidden reasoning is omitted.</p>
  {% for row in data.response_corpus %}
  <h4>{{ row.model }} — {{ row.query_id }}</h4>
  <pre>{{ row.text or "" }}</pre>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}
</section>
